    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-5" id="fn-5" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Other deliveries represent increased linepack and Gas Used for Other Operations and Transmission expenses.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Bison&#8217;s pipeline system did not utilize any compression facilities during the reporting period, and there was no contractual throughput on the system. Accordingly, no company use gas was retained for compressor fuel.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-7" id="fn-7" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Bison&#8217;s pipeline system did not utilize any compression facilities during the reporting period, and there was no contractual throughput on the system. Accordingly, no company use gas was retained for compressor fuel.&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Tracked and non-tracked fuel is valued each month based on the Platt's Gas Daily Cheyenne Hub Index on the last flow day of the month.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-8" id="fn-8" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes $215,057 for Right of Use Operating Leases. See Note to Financial Statements.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-9" id="fn-9" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes $111,866 for Accumulated Amortization of Right of Use Operating Leases. See Note to Financial Statements.</link:footnote>
